# Network loss: monitoring and printing continue, SMS and uploads wait and are delivered once
present: seri-tool 0\.\d+\.\d+ \(SIM x60\) booting
in-order: SMS to \+919876543210: Shed-1: OK\s*$
in-order: LOG E,\d+,TempHigh,Start
in-order: PRINTER\| .* TEMP HIGH 31\.0C
in-order: SMS to \+919876543210: Shed-1: Temp HIGH 31\.0C
in-order: MQTT PUBLISH seri/seri-sim/data
in-order: MQTT PUBLISH seri/seri-sim/data
count == 1: SMS to .*Temp HIGH 31\.0C \(safe
present: LOG S,\d+,310,850
